{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17167","headline":"卧病喜惠上人李链师茅处士见访因以赠 · 权德舆","name":"卧病喜惠上人李链师茅处士见访因以赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沈疴结繁虑，卧见书窗曙。\n方外三贤人，惠然来相亲。\n整巾起曳策，喜非车马客。\n支郎有佳文，新句淩碧云。\n霓裳何飘飘，浩志淩紫氛。\n复有沈冥士，远系三茅君。\n各言麋鹿性，不与簪组羣。\n清言出象系，旷迹逃玄纁。\n心源蹔澄寂，世故方糺纷。\n终当逐师辈，岩桂香氲芬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17167.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17167","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}